<section class="how">
    <h2>How to Use the Days Until Calculator</h2>
    <p>Select a preset holiday from the quick buttons or type a custom date into the date picker. Add an event name if you want a personalized countdown label. Hit Calculate and the result shows instantly.</p>
    <p>The countdown updates to the exact second. It counts full days remaining based on midnight of the target date. So if you check it on December 23rd, it shows 2 days until Christmas, meaning Christmas Day itself is 2 days away.</p>
    <p>You can also use this to count backward. If the date you enter is in the past, the tool will show you how many days ago that event occurred.</p>
</section>

<section class="formula">
    <h2>How Days Until Is Calculated</h2>
    <p>The formula is simple. The tool takes the target date's midnight timestamp in milliseconds, subtracts today's current timestamp, and divides the difference by the number of milliseconds in a day (86,400,000).</p>
    <p><strong>Days Until = (Target Date - Today) / 86,400,000</strong></p>
    <p>The remaining milliseconds after extracting full days are divided by 3,600,000 for hours, and 60,000 for minutes. Weeks are calculated by dividing the total days by 7.</p>
</section>

