<section class="faq">
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

    <h3>How many days until Christmas?</h3>
    <p>Click the Christmas preset button above for an instant countdown. Christmas is always December 25th. The result updates to show exactly how many days, hours, and minutes remain until 12:00 AM on December 25th.</p>

    <h3>How many days until New Year?</h3>
    <p>Select the New Year preset or enter January 1st of the next year. New Year's Day falls on January 1st every year. The countdown will reflect the exact time remaining in your local timezone.</p>

    <h3>Can I use this as a birthday countdown?</h3>
    <p>Yes. Enter your birthday in the custom date field and optionally type your name or "My Birthday" in the event name box. The countdown will display with your custom label and update every time you visit.</p>

    <h3>Does the countdown account for my time zone?</h3>
    <p>Yes. The calculator uses your device's local time and timezone automatically. The target date is set to midnight local time on the day you enter, so results are accurate wherever you are in the world.</p>
</section>

